<p>Booking a private transfer in advance means this is worked out well before departure morning. Confirm your flight number and preferred pickup time when you book, and mention any heavy suitcases so your driver can plan the short walk from the hotel to the car accordingly — Dalt Vila's steepest lanes and stone stairways are no place to be improvising with wheeled luggage five minutes before you need to leave.</p>
