<p>A private chauffeur also means a fixed price agreed before you travel, with your driver tracking your flight so that an unexpected delay finding your way down through Dalt Vila's lanes doesn't turn checkout into a scramble. For a hotel built around slowing down and taking in centuries of history, that certainty fits the rest of the stay.</p>
